        <section class="dashboard-card participation-upload" aria-labelledby="participation-upload-title">
            <h2 id="participation-upload-title">3. Upload Excel file</h2>
            <p id="student-excel-help">Choose a fest and event, then upload an Excel (.xlsx) file with an Enrollment number or Mobile number column. Matching registered students are automatically added to the selected event. Duplicate and unmatched rows are skipped. Up to 5 MB and 10,000 rows.</p>
            <label for="student-excel-file">Excel file</label>
            <input id="student-excel-file" type="file" accept=".xlsx,application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.spreadsheetml.sheet" aria-describedby="student-excel-help student-excel-status" disabled>
            <p id="student-excel-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Select a fest and event to upload a file.</p>
            <div id="student-excel-preview" hidden>
                <div class="excel-preview-toolbar">
